			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"## 📦 WAN Models to Download\n\n---\n\n### 🔴 Main WAN Model  \n`Wan2.1_14B_T2V-FusionX`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://civitai.com/models/1651125?modelVersionId=1882322)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/diffusion_models`\n\n---\n\n### 🟣 WAN VAE  \n`WAN2.1-VAE_module_14B_bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/Wan2_1_VAE_bf16.safetensors?download=true)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/vae`\n\n---\n### 🟣 WAN clip \n`clip_vision_h.safetensors.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Wan_2.1_ComfyUI_repackaged/resolve/main/split_files/clip_vision/clip_vision_h.safetensors)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/clip`\n\n---\n### 🟣 WAN Text Encoder\n`umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors`  \n🔗 [Download Link](https://huggingface.co/Kijai/WanVideo_comfy/resolve/main/umt5-xxl-enc-bf16.safetensors)\n\n🗂️ Place in: `ComfyUI/models/text_encoders`\n\n---\n### ⚠️ Torch Compile Warning  \nIf your setup doesn’t support torch compile, set attention mode to `sdpa` in the model loader, bypass the torch compile node and chang ethe base_precision to fp16\n\n---\n\n### ⚠️ Block Swapping\nBlock swapping helps with Lower VRAM GPU's and OOM. You can swap up to 40 but it will decrease generation speed. Only use it if you need to.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
